cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite PAL v2.1 for new PAL-led realization audits, PAL v2.0 for historical Attack Runs 0001 and 0002, and this repository only for the bounded Lean audit implementation."
title: "PAL Lean Audit — Primitive Axiom Layers"
abstract: "An adversarial Lean 4 audit of Primitive Axiom Layers (PAL). The repository tests bounded mathematical realizations and countermodels against source-locked PAL releases while preserving PAL's declared authority boundaries."
